, permissionless recovery. PREPARE or READY → HELD."}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"ds-def","children":[["$","dt",null,{"className":"ds-def-label","children":"getHandshake(id)"}],["$","dd",null,{"className":"ds-def-value","children":"Read-only lifecycle record: state, party, timestamps, both prepare commitments, evidence manifest, settlement evidence."}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"ds-def","children":[["$","dt",null,{"className":"ds-def-label","children":"isCommitted(id)"}],["$","dd",null,{"className":"ds-def-value","children":"The only authorization a source-chain lock should accept before making a leg irreversible."}]]}]]}]]}]]}]
